<%# Sent once when Zoho rejects a company's own Zoho Sign credentials (ZohoSignConnectionNotifier). %>
Dear User,

<p>
  Zoho rejected <%= @entity.name %>'s Zoho Sign account credentials on <%= l(@connection.updated_at) %>.
  Until the account is reconnected, documents cannot be sent for eSignature through it, and documents
  already sent on it are not updated.
</p>

<p>
  To reconnect: generate a new grant code for your Zoho Self Client (Zoho API console › Self Client ›
  Generate Code), then open the company page on CapHive and use <strong>Zoho eSign › Reconnect</strong>.
</p>

Thank you.
